 "nl": [
  "No packet from vpn-users may enter edge-cache, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from guest-wifi to cameras but deny RDP (TCP 3389), MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "partners must accept SNMP (UDP 161) and syslog (UDP 514) and LDAP (TCP 389) from ntp-servers.",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80) on research reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow admin to connect to backup using HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "No packet from backup may enter admin, even for services open to everyone.",
  "dns-servers offers HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone.",
  "Allow mail to connect to dns-servers using SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Hosts in hr may reach backup over SMB (TCP 445) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "dns-servers offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "backup must never reach ntp-servers, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Restrict printers so that its only permitted destinations are engineering on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "admin offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Allow partners to connect to printers using DNS over UDP 53."
 ],
